<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Harbour Centre suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Harbour Centre suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of hotel and property investment group Harbour Centre Development Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares rose HK$1.05 or 8.97 percent to end at HK$12.75 on Wednesday. Volume was 1.002 million shares worth HK$12.31 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
